    "topic's own list if it has one), must not be from blocked_domains, and",
    "must match at least one keyword. Single-word keywords only count if",
    "they appear in the TITLE -- otherwise 'chip' matches a writer named",
    "Chip. Multi-word keywords match title or summary."
